Subject: CPMS I03A Activation Candidate Revision 1 Data Design

@ [design_uuid] f3649f0d-f712-48b1-b46c-2edc6fe2f6a7

& [ValidatorConfigurationRecord] has exact fields
  + engine jsonschema
  + version 0.49.2
  + draft draft_2020_12
  + validate_formats false
  + ignore_unknown_formats true
  + custom_format_count 0
  + retriever probe_deny_retriever

& [ReferencePreflightObservation] has case_id keyword_location raw_target_digest target_class resolved_location disposition rule_id
  + dispositions are admitted_local_fragment refused internal_fault exhausted
  + ordering is lexical by case_id then keyword location then raw target digest

& [RetrieverObservation] has invocation_count first_target_digest denial_class and effect_count
  + successful focused proof requires invocation_count 0
  + any positive invocation_count produces internal_fault and fails the proof
  + effect_count is always 0 or the candidate is invalid

& [MetaConstructionPair] has meta_disposition construction_disposition repeated_internal_schema_check_disclosed and stable_rule_ids
  + repeated_internal_schema_check_disclosed is true
  + the pair never claims operational independence

& [SourceOwnership] maps schema_validator_dependency.rs to I03A ProbeDenyRetriever
  + reader_observation.rs and CantorDenyRetriever map to future I03D only

& [ReferenceCaseFamilies] are local_pointer local_anchor HTTP HTTPS file relative UNC drive_letter unknown_scheme empty malformed missing escaping and dynamic
  + only locally resolvable pointer or anchor may be admitted
  + root dialect identity is recorded outside retrieval cases

& [DeterminismProjection] includes stable disposition rule identity counts and digests
  + engine display messages are excluded
  + error source strings are diagnostic only

& [DesignDisposition] is exact_test_only_revision_data_no_production_form
